  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "酸味と　苦味を　感じる　調味料。脂っこい　食材と　相性が　よく意外と　応用が利く　食材だ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신맛과 쓴맛을 느낄 수 있는 조미료. 느끼한 식재료와 궁합이 잘 맞아서 의외로 응용법이 다양한 식재료다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "會感覺到酸味和苦味的調味料。和油膩的食材相當搭配，活用範圍意外地廣泛。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût acide et amer. Plus utile qu’on peut le croire de prime abord, notamment pour accompagner des ingrédients gras, qu’il complète à merveille.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses säuerliche und bittere Würzmittel ist äußerst praktisch, da es überraschend gut zu fettigen Zutaten passt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ingrediente con un toque amargo y ácido que tiene más usos de los que parecería a simple vista, pues casa de maravilla con otros con alto contenido graso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento aspro e amaro, inaspettatamente versatile perché si abbina bene con gli ingredienti grassi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment with sour and bitter notes. It’s surprisingly useful, as it makes a nice counterpoint to oilier foods.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
